$string['studenthelpintro'] = 'From this block you can check your recognised HEE hours and access the main student actions. The final target is 54 recognised hours.';
$string['studenthelpjoin_title'] = '1. How to join a seminar';
$string['studenthelpjoin_text'] = 'Each workshop in the course has a «Sign me up» button. When you press it the page reloads and the button changes to «Leave»: you are enrolled. Check the date, time, places and enrolment deadline first. You can leave until the workshop starts. The workshop content (attendance, quiz or reflection and materials) only appears once you are enrolled. If a workshop lasts two days you must attend both: «Present» is required on both days.';
$string['studenthelpa_title'] = '2. Type A seminars';
$string['studenthelpa_text'] = 'To get the hours you need both: attendance marked «Present» in the workshop list and the workshop quiz («Cuestionario T0X») finished with at least 5 out of 10 before it closes. The «Materiales T0X» folder is available from enrolment until the quiz closes.';
$string['studenthelpb_title'] = '3. Internal Type B seminars';
$string['studenthelpb_text'] = 'To get the hours you need both: attendance marked «Present» and the reflection submitted. The reflection is a Moodle assignment written as online text (no file attached). If the deadline has passed, ask the teacher for an individual extension. The «Materiales T0X» folder is available until the reflection deadline.';
$string['studenthelppat_title'] = '4. First-year Type B PAT workshops';
$string['studenthelppat_text'] = 'PAT workshops completed in first year are added automatically to your Type B hours once HEE Management can link the historical record to your Moodle account. A PAT workshop counts only when full attendance and a quiz grade of at least half the maximum (equivalent to 5 out of 10) are recorded. No reflection or certificate upload is required for these workshops. If you expect PAT hours and they do not appear, contact HEE Management so the identity link can be checked.';
$string['studenthelpbexternal_title'] = '5. External Type B training';
$string['studenthelpbexternal_text'] = 'If you attended an external Type B workshop, use «Solicitar validación Tipo B»: choose the workshop from the list (title and hours come from the catalogue), give the date and upload the certificate as PDF, JPG or PNG (max 20 MB). Each workshop can only be submitted once. Until it is validated you can correct it with «Editar». The manager validates it first and then you write the reflection; the hours count once both steps are done.';
$string['studenthelpcerts_title'] = '6. Certificates and portfolio';
$string['studenthelpcerts_text'] = 'Certificates are generated automatically when the workshop ends (quiz close or reflection deadline) and the hours are added to your portfolio. «Mi portafolio HEE» shows your history, hours and PDF certificates. Finished workshop editions disappear from the course, but your certificates and hours stay in the portfolio.';
$string['studenthelptransfer_title'] = '7. Transfer Type A hours to Type B';
$string['studenthelptransfer_text'] = 'The “Transfer Type A hours to Type B” button lets you check whether you meet the transfer conditions. The system only offers options compatible with your current hours. A transfer changes the distribution between Type A and Type B, but does not increase your recognised total.';
$string['studenthelpselfassessment_title'] = '8. Final self-assessment';
$string['studenthelpselfassessment_text'] = 'When you reach 54 recognised hours the Self-assessment section and its quiz appear in the course automatically. Until then it stays closed.';
$string['studenthelpfooter'] = 'If an hour, certificate, attendance record or reflection does not appear as expected, first check the seminar status. If the problem remains, contact the seminar teacher or Gestión HEE.';
$string['teacherhelpbutton'] = 'TEACHER INSTRUCTIONS';
$string['teacherhelptitle'] = 'Quick guide for HEE workshop teachers';
$string['teacherhelpintro'] = 'Your workshop is already created: no groups, lists or activities to set up. Just take attendance, upload materials and, in Type A, add the quiz questions.';
$string['teacherhelpcommon_title'] = '1. All workshops';
$string['teacherhelpcommon_text'] = 'Each workshop has its group, «Asistencia T0X» attendance list, «Materiales T0X» folder and activity (quiz in Type A, reflection in Type B). Orange «Lista de clase» button: printable signature sheet. Take attendance in «Asistencia T0X»: only «Present» counts; fix mistakes there. Upload files to «Materiales T0X»: only enrolled students see them. Two-day workshops: the list has one session per day and the «Lista de clase» one signature per day; take attendance both days, «Present» is required on both.';
$string['teacherhelpa_title'] = '2. Type A workshops (attendance + quiz)';
$string['teacherhelpa_text'] = 'Open «Cuestionario T0X» and add the questions. Check the closing date. A student passes with «Present» and a grade of 5 or more out of 10.';
$string['teacherhelpb_title'] = '3. Type B workshops (attendance + reflection)';
$string['teacherhelpb_text'] = 'The reflection is an online-text assignment; it does not need grading. A student passes with «Present» and the reflection submitted. Grant individual extensions from the assignment if needed.';
$string['teacherhelpend_title'] = '4. When the workshop ends';
$string['teacherhelpend_text'] = 'When the quiz or reflection deadline closes, certificates are generated for students who meet the requirements and the hours are added to the record. A finished workshop is not read-only for the assigned HEE Teacher or manager: it remains available under “My finished workshops” for academic corrections when needed. Attendance can be corrected in Attendance; Type A grades are corrected in the Moodle quiz (or the historical assignment where applicable); Type B has no numeric grade and an individual late-reflection extension can be granted when needed. After a correction, review the result and regenerate the certificate if necessary.';
$string['teacherhelproles_title'] = '5. Where to find your workshops';
